$$S=\frac{E_0^2}{\mu_0c}\cos^2(kx-\omega t)e_x,\qquad
\langle S\rangle=\frac{E_0^2}{2\mu_0c}e_x.$$
The <Poynting vector> is electromagnetic energy flux, and its average is the wave intensity.

