At that point the <vector> field is
$$f(p)=(1/54,-1/54)\ne0,$$
so $\{p\}$ is not invariant. The largest invariant subset of $\{\dot Q=0\}$ is therefore the origin. LaSalle's invariance principle shows that every trajectory in the closed ellipse converges to the origin. The inequality may consequently be extended to $Q\leq1$.

