Sz=\lim_n S(Rx_n)=\lim_n Tx_n=Tx=S(Rx).
$$
Since $S$ is injective, $z=Rx$. Thus $\Gamma(R)$ is closed. The domain and codomain $X$ are Banach spaces, so the closed graph theorem implies
$$
