The convention $A_{N+1}=\infty$ ensures $\tau^*\leq N$, so $\tau^*$ is a bounded stopping time.

By minimality, $A_{\tau^*}=0$ and $A_{\tau^*+1}-A_{\tau^*}>0$. Part (d) then gives
$$
V_{\tau^*}=Z_{\tau^*}.
