$$\Gamma(z)\sim\frac1z,
\qquad
\Gamma(2z)\sim\frac1{2z}.$$
Using part (a),
$$
B(z,z)=\frac{\Gamma(z)^2}{\Gamma(2z)}
\sim\frac{z^{-2}}{(2z)^{-1}}
=\boxed{\frac2z}.
$$

